    "description": "A handsome pair of Italian sterling silver rope-chain necklaces with the dimensional twisted construction that makes this classic chain style catch the light from every angle. Substantial enough to wear alone yet versatile enough for layering or pairing with a favorite pendant.\nBoth necklaces are visibly hallmarked “925,” indicating sterling silver, with an additional “ITALY” marking visible on the clasp hardware. The warm patina currently present gives the silver an appealing vintage character and could be left as-is or polished according to the buyer’s preference.\nPhotographed individually on a precision scale:\nNecklace 1: 16.500 g\nNecklace 2: 16.692 g\nCombined photographed weight: 33.192 g\nThe matching rope construction makes these especially useful as a two-chain layering set while the Italian origin and documented sterling marks add collector and resale appeal.\nCondition: Pre-owned condition with visible natural tarnish/patina and light wear consistent with use. Clasps, links and hallmarks are shown in the photographs. No professional polishing has been performed.\nDisplay bust, magnifier, scale and calibration weight not included.",
